    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the election law, in relation to requiring the hand counting\nof all ballots cast in an election for a position in which the difference in\nthe ballots cast for the candidates for such position is ten or less votes or\n.5 percent of votes cast, whichever is greater",
    "basePrintNo": "S1833",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S1833-2019",
